\subsection{The Proportionality Test: Smoking Gun}

The imposed constraint of the scalar LP is that
$\mathrm{IRF}_k(h)/\mathrm{IRF}_{\mathrm{FP}}(h)$ must be constant in $h$
(equation~\ref{eq:prop_constraint}).  Figure~\ref{fig:channels} plots this
ratio for each non-FP shock across horizons.

